---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = '2026-06-05';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use – Ynvesters"
  description="Terms and conditions for using Ynvesters, an AI tools review and comparison site."
>
  <div style="max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; line-height:1.8;">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted); font-size:0.9rem; margin-bottom:2rem;">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>
      By accessing or using ynvesters.com (the "Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use.
      If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use the Site.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Informational Purpose</h2>
    <p>
      All content published on Ynvesters is provided for informational and educational purposes only.
      Nothing on this Site constitutes professional advice — financial, legal, technical, or otherwise.
      You should independently verify information before making purchasing or business decisions based on
      content you read here.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      The text, images, graphics, and other content on this Site are owned by or licensed to Ynvesters.
      You may quote short excerpts with appropriate attribution and a link to the original article.
      Republishing full articles without written permission is not permitted.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>
      The Site contains links to third-party websites. These links are provided for convenience and
      reference only. Ynvesters has no control over the content, accuracy, or availability of linked sites
      and is not responsible for any loss or damage that may arise from your use of them.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This Site displays advertisements through Google AdSense. By using the Site, you acknowledge that
      advertisements may appear alongside content. Ynvesters is not responsible for the content of
      third-party advertisements. Clicking on advertisements is at your own discretion.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Accuracy of Information</h2>
    <p>
      We make reasonable efforts to ensure that the information on this Site is accurate and up to date.
      However, AI tools, pricing, and features change frequently. Ynvesters makes no warranty, express or
      implied, regarding the completeness, accuracy, or timeliness of any content. Prices and availability
      listed in articles reflect information available at the time of publication.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, Ynvesters and its operators shall not be liable for any
      direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of, or inability to use,
      this Site or its content.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Use at any time. Changes will be reflected by the
      "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Your continued use of the Site after any changes
      constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms? Please reach out via our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
